<title>SPAIN: Pryca to pay dividend on June 2.</title>
<headline>Pryca to pay dividend on June 2.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Pryca said on Monday the annual shareholders meeting had agreed to pay on June 2 the previously announced 65 pesetas/share gross dividend.  </p>
<p>Shareholders meeting also approved the previously announced plan to pay a 133 peseta per share issue premium for the 1992 capital increase.</p>
<p>In total, the payout will be 198 pesetas a share for a total of 37.47 billion pesetas, Pryca said.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 41 585 2167</p>
</text>
